  "details": "There is always 1 thing that absolutely ruins my immersion about most of the video games. The proximity chat. I know it's going to be pretty hard to implement, but since you have also the earmuff setting, it's gonna be easier to make. Basically: The louder your db's, the farer people can hear you. Which will also make whispering and screaming, work? For example, if your DB's are lower than medium, people will hear you up to 10 game meters. If it's going to be around the medium, people will hear you up to 25. If it's more than the medium, people will hear you for up to 50 meters.",
